=== WHAT THIS STILL CANNOT SAY ===
  Our own quote is absent from the book it is measured against, so the
  flow that filled us is flow that existed WITHOUT us. That biases
  toward optimism and no tape can remove it. This is a screen for
  whether the shield has any effect at all, not a P&L forecast.
